# Integrations layer ownership

- **Write**: `server/src/integrations/**`, integration-focused `server/src/jobs/**`, and the QuickBooks/Sheets service utilities listed in `.agents/integrations/AGENTS.md`.
- **Do not**: change Mongoose schemas; build UI; store secrets outside established patterns; call providers from controllers—expose via services the Backend orchestrates.

All sync paths need explicit idempotency, retry behavior, and use of external IDs. Align with `.agents/integrations/AGENTS.md`.
